      "note": "on a real terminal: the status line is GREEN (bold) with the disable hint — the same layout as the disabled state below it: the grey switch/presets line with socks5h://host:port per preset (auth fields shown when set), the deciding proxy_active line white-highlighted, the whole config.json in grey",
